include docs/HARDENING_071.md

# Retain current README-linked guidance and release/attribution inputs in sdists.
include NOTICE THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md ARCHITECTURE.md CHANGELOG.md RELEASE_NOTES.md
include CONTRIBUTING.md GOVERNANCE.md SECURITY.md SUPPORT.md ROADMAP.md CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
